Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.05,0:00:42.97,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0030,0035)}{\frz1.378\pos(544,460)}A{\fntangak}lchemistry
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.41,1:25:36.37,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,125)}{\pos(792,526)}D{\fs55}y{\fs}w
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.05,0:00:42.97,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0030, 0035)}{\pos(792,526)}D{\fs55}y{\fs}w
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.09,0:02:52.09,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.09,0:02:57.09,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Martini, gaarysn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.09,0:03:02.09,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee, Mina_Mi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.06,0:00:45.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you for showing everything
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:47.57,general text,,0,0,0,,- Waiting for your decision\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:55.66,general text,,0,0,0,,This place is right between Jinyovon and Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.37,0:00:58.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Tiles and floors are good
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.70,0:01:01.29,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the best option we have seen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.37,0:01:04.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t you think there are too many rooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.34,0:01:06.09,general text,,0,0,0,,They will have children soon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.17,0:01:09.22,general text,,0,0,0,,The son will take the surname Pak and lead Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.30,0:01:12.89,general text,,0,0,0,,The daughter will take the surname Jin and lead Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.97,0:01:14.35,general text,,0,0,0,,They should give birth to more
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.10,0:01:18.93,general text,,0,0,0,,It's good that I asked you to join me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.02,0:01:22.81,general text,,0,0,0,,I will choose the house that you like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.69,0:01:28.73,general text,,0,0,0,,To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.57,0:01:33.57,general text,,0,0,0,,I wouldn’t want to live in a big house
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.62,0:01:37.08,general text,,0,0,0,,I like a cozy house,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.58,0:01:41.41,general text,,0,0,0,,where my husband and I will live happily
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:46.75,general text,,0,0,0,,With a small garden where you can plant your favorite flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.80,0:01:50.84,general text,,0,0,0,,You love flowers so much
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:54.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should plant balsam?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.43,0:01:58.97,general text,,0,0,0,,My husband and I would paint our nails with paints from it*
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.43,0:01:58.97,notes,,0,0,0,,*balsam root was crushed and used to paint nails and fingertips yellow
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:04.69,general text,,0,0,0,,It would be great to live like this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.69,0:02:09.44,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll look for you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:12.28,general text,,0,0,0,,such a house
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.28,0:02:19.45,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:23.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I will buy a house with a small garden
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.75,general text,,0,0,0,,and I’ll plant balsam
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.58,0:02:29.17,general text,,0,0,0,,This will be my gift
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.59,0:02:31.67,general text,,0,0,0,,for your wedding
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.76,0:02:37.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.51,0:02:41.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li loved Sapsari so much
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.02,0:02:45.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll give you a puppy too
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.15,0:02:51.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you marrying me to Master Li now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.11,0:02:56.24,general text,,0,0,0,,You said that you were happy just looking at him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.74,0:03:02.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think I was happy looking at Master Li?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:07.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m not completely stupid
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:09.38,general text,,0,0,0,,That is, you will generously give me a house,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.46,0:03:12.84,general text,,0,0,0,,if I marry Master Li?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:17.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I have money for such a gift
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.93,0:03:20.01,general text,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:23.89,general text,,0,0,0,,buy me a house with a hundred rooms
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.48,0:03:25.64,general text,,0,0,0,,One hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:30.11,general text,,0,0,0,,So you like big houses?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.40,0:03:34.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Still, I’m a little slow-witted
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.61,0:03:36.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.03,0:03:39.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Feelings for you made me happy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.63,0:03:52.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I hoped
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:56.09,general text,,0,0,0,,you will understand sooner or later
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:04:00.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Cooked your favorite dishes, sewed your clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:05.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Although you are slow, I hoped that one day
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.43,0:04:07.60,general text,,0,0,0,,will reach you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:11.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you passing me off as someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.73,0:04:14.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Give me a house for my wedding with someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.90,0:04:17.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.45,0:04:21.57,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.66,0:04:22.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.28,0:04:27.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Choosing a home together,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:31.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I imagined how we would get married,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:35.17,general text,,0,0,0,,how we will paint each other’s nails in love
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:37.63,general text,,0,0,0,,balsam flowers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.72,0:04:40.09,general text,,0,0,0,,who picked in the garden
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.55,0:04:44.60,general text,,0,0,0,,In love?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:47.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes! In love!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.68,0:04:48.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Carrot Love!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.98,0:04:52.73,general text,,0,0,0,,In love!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.81,0:04:55.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes! Exactly! In love!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:05:00.45,general text,,0,0,0,,This picture stands so vividly before my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.53,0:05:01.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.70,0:05:03.20,general text,,0,0,0,,You shattered my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.28,0:05:05.99,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t expect anything more from you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.91,0:05:10.08,general text,,0,0,0,,But I’ll accept a house with a hundred rooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.71,0:05:12.75,general text,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.83,0:05:15.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.51,0:05:19.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.22,0:05:23.59,general text,,0,0,0,,In love...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:28.02,general text,,0,0,0,,I destroyed everything
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.39,0:05:31.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Idiot
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.15,0:05:36.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Excellent
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:39.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll marry someone
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.57,0:05:41.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Let him give me a home!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.28,0:05:44.91,general text,,0,0,0,,There you are
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.99,0:05:48.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Servant Kim, are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:51.37,general text,,0,0,0,,No. Why should I cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:55.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you crying? Who upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:58.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Your tears break my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.17,0:06:00.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm just jealous,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.84,0:06:04.93,general text,,0,0,0,,that Mr. Dan Gu will marry before you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.51,0:06:07.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm jealous and sad
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.85,0:06:10.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t be sad. I'm getting married soon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:12.31,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.10,0:06:16.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you finally decided to marry someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.73,0:06:20.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, so there is no reason for envy and sadness
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:21.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.99,0:06:24.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Then this should be left
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.57,0:06:26.99,general text,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:30.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Gifts for your wedding that I kept
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.29,0:06:33.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about giving them to Mr. Dan Gu and Ms. Cho Yeon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:35.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Why give it to them? A waste
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.58,0:06:36.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.67,0:06:39.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Give them to Mrs. Ho?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:42.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Why does she need it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:44.22,general text,,0,0,0,,You said you were getting married
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:45.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I know everything
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.97,0:06:47.97,general text,,0,0,0,,She is your egg
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.22,0:06:52.60,general text,,0,0,0,,- My egg?\N- Your secret lover
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.39,0:06:57.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Egg of a graceful heron on a treetop
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.23,0:07:03.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Servant Kim, you misunderstood. This is not the same bird
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:05.90,general text,,0,0,0,,- Isn’t she?\N- No
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.99,0:07:10.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought she would hatch from an egg
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:13.25,general text,,0,0,0,,There is someone else, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:16.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:19.04,general text,,0,0,0,,And who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:23.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Servant Kim, just don’t be surprised
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:24.88,general text,,0,0,0,,And if you can’t restrain yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.97,0:07:26.55,general text,,0,0,0,,bite your handkerchief
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.22,0:07:30.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Who could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.26,0:07:33.06,general text,,0,0,0,,There were no other girls near you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:43.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:47.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Moo Deok will get it all
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.74,0:07:54.91,general text,,0,0,0,,It can’t be
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:58.58,general text,,0,0,0,,How is that? What about Mrs. Ho?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.59,0:08:04.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I see things are going well between you and Mr. Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:05.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.05,0:08:08.34,general text,,0,0,0,,I decided to marry him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.43,0:08:10.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I like to spread all sorts of rumors
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.84,0:08:13.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Please. Let everyone know that I changed my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.27,0:08:18.89,general text,,0,0,0,,The news of your wedding will clear up all obscene rumors
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.52,0:08:20.73,general text,,0,0,0,,"Indecent rumors"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.81,0:08:23.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Many people gossiped that he was impotent,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:25.23,general text,,0,0,0,,times chastity practices
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.98,0:08:27.15,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not true
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.24,0:08:29.66,general text,,0,0,0,,That's what everyone said. This is wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:32.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Not a word of truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.33,0:08:34.91,general text,,0,0,0,,So you checked it yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:38.12,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.21,0:08:40.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it. And that's why I decided to marry him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:43.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Which woman will marry an impotent man,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.38,0:08:45.25,general text,,0,0,0,,even if he is a rich heir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.34,0:08:46.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:48.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, I'll tell everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.72,0:08:50.63,general text,,0,0,0,,"She checked, he is not impotent"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.72,0:08:52.34,general text,,0,0,0,,We haven’t slept together yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.30,0:08:55.26,general text,,0,0,0,,We really didn’t have anything yet
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.14,0:08:58.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t be shy. I'm older
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.23,0:09:04.65,general text,,0,0,0,,You were so harmful when we first met
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:06.48,general text,,0,0,0,,And now, a heart has appeared
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:13.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought that one day you would break off relations with everyone and disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:18.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you I changed fate
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:23.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I will stay and protect those I love
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.58,0:09:26.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently you like him a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:32.63,general text,,0,0,0,,I wish you a happy life
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.31,0:09:44.19,italics,,0,0,0,,I will pick up a sword that will help you destroy Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:49.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Only I can protect you by saving you from the King’s star
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.86,0:09:51.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook lost all his strength
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.24,0:09:55.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I gave all my energy to destroy the barrier
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.91,0:10:00.20,general text,,0,0,0,,He cannot become the next Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.29,0:10:02.16,general text,,0,0,0,,He lost his influence
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.50,0:10:06.75,general text,,0,0,0,,And everyone thinks that the King’s star has shone for me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.71,0:10:12.67,general text,,0,0,0,,You have nothing to offer me, Deputy Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:17.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Gan sacrificed himself in the name of
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.93,0:10:19.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor, Jinyeowon and Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:23.77,general text,,0,0,0,,But Jin Woo Tak is alive, you will be found guilty
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:27.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to punish my former teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.15,0:10:31.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Clarify everything and accept the punishment
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.70,0:10:37.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you really think that the stone has disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.87,0:10:42.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Ice stone is filled with heavenly energy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.33,0:10:44.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Born under the star of the King
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:47.58,general text,,0,0,0,,is endowed with this power
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.54,0:10:50.67,general text,,0,0,0,,What will you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:54.34,general text,,0,0,0,,if Chang Wook is hiding this power?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:03.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I will wait for your response
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:07.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I will always be faithful to you, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.17,0:11:31.80,general text,,0,0,0,,You came to your senses, but you continue to remain silent?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.84,0:11:39.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I saved you only so that you would atone for your sins
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.22,0:11:41.76,general text,,0,0,0,,in front of our daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.06,0:11:44.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Before Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:51.02,general text,,0,0,0,,When we first met,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.32,0:11:55.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I fell in love with your warm smile
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.66,0:12:00.12,memories,,0,0,0,,That’s cute too
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:04.12,memories,,0,0,0,,I think this will suit our Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.96,0:12:10.17,general text,,0,0,0,,And from the moment of our meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.25,0:12:12.50,general text,,0,0,0,,in love with you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.88,0:12:15.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t love anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:18.38,general text,,0,0,0,,except
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.43,0:12:27.81,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to clarify something for you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.52,0:12:32.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I say this so that you suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.07,0:12:37.94,general text,,0,0,0,,I want you to know,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.03,0:12:42.16,general text,,0,0,0,,deceived Jin Mu, you did this to our daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.74,0:12:45.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope you will suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:11.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Woo Tak in Saejukwon
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.14,0:13:12.77,general text,,0,0,0,,He came to his senses
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.27,0:13:15.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Since he is alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.48,0:13:18.36,general text,,0,0,0,,he will probably betray me and our organization
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.44,0:13:20.07,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to get rid of him
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.53,0:13:29.12,general text,,0,0,0,,I brought the ashes of the queen’s souls
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:32.17,general text,,0,0,0,,and bells, as you ordered
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.39,0:14:35.06,general text,,0,0,0,,I can make all the nomads go crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.90,0:14:39.44,general text,,0,0,0,,If Chang Wook has the power of an ice stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:42.74,general text,,0,0,0,,he will have to show them
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.74,0:14:51.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Make them two rings
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:56.12,general text,,0,0,0,,You ordered two rings
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.21,0:14:58.21,general text,,0,0,0,,So the rumors don’t lie
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.75,0:15:02.05,general text,,0,0,0,,These are rings for a wedding, do everything well
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:03.05,italics,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.13,0:15:05.51,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll do everything in the best possible way
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.59,0:15:08.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Take a look at these options
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:09.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Which one do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.97,0:15:11.64,general text,,0,0,0,,These are beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.72,0:15:12.68,general text,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.35,0:15:15.39,general text,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.48,0:15:18.48,general text,,0,0,0,,It belonged to Mrs. Young Ok
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.56,0:15:20.52,general text,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no, not these\N- Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.61,0:15:21.98,general text,,0,0,0,,They are not very
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.98,0:15:25.20,general text,,0,0,0,,- And this?\N- No...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.28,0:15:26.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:28.74,general text,,0,0,0,,- Mrs. So Jeong...\N- Not the same either
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.32,0:15:31.08,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t like anything
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.16,0:15:33.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I will remove those that do not suit you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:37.25,general text,,0,0,0,,These...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.17,0:15:39.54,general text,,0,0,0,,And these
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.59,0:15:41.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:44.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Choose from the remaining
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.80,0:15:48.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Seven rings?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:03.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:07.11,general text,,0,0,0,,It didn’t seem like there were seven. I really don't remember anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:09.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Were they like Cho Young?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:12.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Promised to marry if the energy gates were opened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.16,0:16:13.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I swear, I didn’t look after them first
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.04,0:16:17.62,general text,,0,0,0,,You yourself said that you need to make an effort not to fall in love with a handsome man
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.71,0:16:20.17,general text,,0,0,0,,They didn’t make enough effort
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.25,0:16:21.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t make me angry
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:24.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Now I’m all yours
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.30,0:16:25.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you proud that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.88,0:16:27.80,general text,,0,0,0,,bypassed everyone and got my heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.93,0:16:32.64,general text,,0,0,0,,If there were a dozen of them, I would be proud
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.72,0:16:34.31,general text,,0,0,0,,And so, just funny
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.39,0:16:35.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think there weren’t that many of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.93,0:16:39.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm kidding. You're the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.06,0:16:41.44,general text,,0,0,0,,I forgot everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:42.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.65,0:16:45.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw several rings when I was cleaning your room
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.53,0:16:47.57,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to find them
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.65,0:16:50.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Why look for rings that no one needs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.99,0:16:53.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m sure there were about a dozen of them
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:55.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Need to check
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.75,0:17:03.08,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t have anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.88,0:17:07.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, let's eat
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:12.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell me honestly
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.26,0:17:13.34,general text,,0,0,0,,How many rings?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:20.19,general text,,0,0,0,,One
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.27,0:17:22.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I will hold your hand in the ring of my hands
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.19,0:17:26.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Definitely no one has such a ring
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:29.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:32.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Since we already have rings,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.57,0:17:35.07,general text,,0,0,0,,there is no need to make them from jade either
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.74,0:17:39.95,italics,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should make some necklaces?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.04,0:17:41.58,general text,,0,0,0,,As you wish
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:44.33,italics,,0,0,0,,I don’t envy Dan Gu one bit
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.88,0:17:48.13,italics,,0,0,0,,- I don’t envy Cho Yeon one bit\N- {\i0}So the rumors are true
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.21,0:17:50.80,general text,,0,0,0,,This mischievous gentleman... is smiling
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.05,0:17:53.34,general text,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.43,0:17:55.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently me from the very beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.89,0:18:00.23,general text,,0,0,0,,understood everything wrong. Such a shame
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.35,0:18:02.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.27,0:18:07.02,general text,,0,0,0,,just don’t say that you confessed your feelings to him in that barrier
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:10.40,general text,,0,0,0,,I was getting ready. I almost confessed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.78,0:18:13.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I had a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.16,0:18:24.75,memories,,0,0,0,,You don’t have to hold a candle next to me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.83,0:18:26.63,memories,,0,0,0,,You can put it somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.88,0:18:31.01,memories,,0,0,0,,Are you embarrassed that I’m here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.09,0:18:32.55,memories,,0,0,0,,Everything suits me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:35.76,memories,,0,0,0,,Well, as you know
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:42.23,memories,,0,0,0,,When you were lying in a drunken stupor in Sejukwon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.31,0:18:45.44,memories,,0,0,0,,my advances didn’t bother you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.52,0:18:47.40,memories,,0,0,0,,I thought you were Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.91,0:19:01.12,general text,,0,0,0,,This is how he is next to his beloved
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.87,0:19:05.50,general text,,0,0,0,,If Mr. Uk had suffered instead of Mr. Yulya,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:08.13,general text,,0,0,0,,you would get closer
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.75,0:19:11.92,general text,,0,0,0,,You are treating the wounded
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.38,0:19:14.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.01,0:19:17.68,general text,,0,0,0,,If he had been wounded,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.39,0:19:22.27,general text,,0,0,0,,would I have a chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.69,0:19:31.98,general text,,0,0,0,,So Yul, I heard you are returning to Soho Fortress
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.07,0:19:34.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, after Dan Gu’s wedding
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.44,0:19:36.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Shall we have a party before you leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.15,0:19:37.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.63,0:19:52.88,italics,,0,0,0,,Your wound has healed, but are you still in pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.84,0:19:57.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought it would get better, but I was wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.68,0:20:00.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Something else happened while I was unconscious
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.09,0:20:01.64,general text,,0,0,0,,was in the barrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.72,0:20:05.85,general text,,0,0,0,,We stopped the bleeding
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.73,0:20:11.61,general text,,0,0,0,,The escaped So Yi gave you her blood
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:16.78,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t donate blood like that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.36,0:20:19.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Why such recklessness?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.95,0:20:22.33,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m just
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.41,0:20:25.20,general text,,0,0,0,,wanted to save him
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.75,0:20:31.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Her blood got into your wound
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.84,0:20:34.84,general text,,0,0,0,,But this should not cause problems
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.92,0:20:36.34,general text,,0,0,0,,I think I'll get better soon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.13,0:20:40.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want the heads to worry, so keep it a secret
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.47,0:20:44.76,italics,,0,0,0,,Okay, to the bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.39,0:20:48.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:51.85,general text,,0,0,0,,What did you steal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:54.52,general text,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.61,0:20:56.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.30,0:21:19.76,general text,,0,0,0,,The wound left by the worm is healing very slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:34.02,general text,,0,0,0,,That worm in his body
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.36,0:21:39.90,general text,,0,0,0,,He’s probably in pain
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.15,0:21:44.24,general text,,0,0,0,,He needs the medicine I took in Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.37,0:21:51.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.83,0:21:57.84,general text,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't work here anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.76,0:22:01.51,general text,,0,0,0,,What? Are you kicking me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.59,0:22:03.63,general text,,0,0,0,,If so, would you listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.72,0:22:06.30,general text,,0,0,0,,- No\N- I knew it wasn’t
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.39,0:22:07.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t make me a bad person
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.60,0:22:12.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t do housework anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.56,0:22:16.98,general text,,0,0,0,,You will be his beloved wife, I cannot force you to work
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.40,0:22:21.19,general text,,0,0,0,,So you accept me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.28,0:22:24.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Do I have a choice? He just adores you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.45,0:22:29.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I will not call you madam
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.54,0:22:32.33,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t consider you my mother-in-law either
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.41,0:22:35.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Why should I be your mother-in-law if I myself am not yet married?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.33,0:22:36.33,general text,,0,0,0,,That would hurt my pride
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.96,0:22:38.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Indeed
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.63,0:22:41.46,general text,,0,0,0,,But you and the head will get married soon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.72,0:22:45.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought you liked each other
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.77,0:22:55.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.90,0:22:59.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Even you noticed it, but he didn’t
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.86,0:23:01.65,general text,,0,0,0,,- Well...\N- That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.73,0:23:04.28,general text,,0,0,0,,How can he be so slow-witted?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.36,0:23:05.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Is he close-minded or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.57,0:23:06.95,general text,,0,0,0,,He's just a fool
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.12,0:23:16.17,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Yes! In love! Love is a carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.12,0:23:18.75,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.00,0:23:22.09,general text,,0,0,0,,forget words,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.17,0:23:23.46,general text,,0,0,0,,which she said
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.76,0:23:26.18,general text,,0,0,0,,me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.89,0:23:38.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Chapter
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.15,0:23:44.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.78,0:23:47.41,general text,,0,0,0,,When did you arrive?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.49,0:23:49.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Recently. I wanted to tell you something
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.91,0:23:53.04,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you so worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.00,0:23:55.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Something terrible
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.71,0:23:58.00,general text,,0,0,0,,concerns me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.87,0:24:01.04,general text,,0,0,0,,What did you want to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.67,0:24:02.88,general text,,0,0,0,,You see...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.96,0:24:07.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I plan to leave the capital for a while after Dan Gu's wedding
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.01,0:24:09.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.26,0:24:12.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.72,0:24:15.31,general text,,0,0,0,,And the maid Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.48,0:24:21.48,general text,,0,0,0,,If no one wants her to stay, I'll have to take her with me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.82,0:24:26.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know when we’ll be back. Maybe in a year, or maybe in ten
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.28,0:24:28.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Or maybe we’ll never come back
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.70,0:24:36.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I did something
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.91,0:24:39.58,general text,,0,0,0,,unforgivable
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.92,0:24:44.38,general text,,0,0,0,,If I keep her here,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.46,0:24:47.72,general text,,0,0,0,,do you think she will stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.18,0:24:50.05,general text,,0,0,0,,She...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.01,0:24:52.97,general text,,0,0,0,,cried
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.90,0:25:04.11,general text,,0,0,0,,She will cry harder if you don't stop her
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.32,0:25:12.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll leave
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.03,0:25:15.24,general text,,0,0,0,,with the young master
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.74,0:25:17.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t leave
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.16,0:25:21.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll leave
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.88,0:25:28.84,general text,,0,0,0,,There is no point in staying. Need to go
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.65,0:25:46.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I want something
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.28,0:25:50.19,general text,,0,0,0,,show you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.16,0:26:03.17,general text,,0,0,0,,These are balsam seeds
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.50,0:26:06.13,general text,,0,0,0,,If you plant them right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.04,0:26:10.09,general text,,0,0,0,,the flowers will bloom in three to four months
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.51,0:26:16.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I can make them bloom right now before your eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.10,0:26:18.01,general text,,0,0,0,,using a spell
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.18,0:26:20.35,general text,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.52,0:26:23.81,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm very slow
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.23,0:26:32.07,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to slowly watch them sprout
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.90,0:26:35.45,general text,,0,0,0,,and bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.79,0:26:43.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Will you wait for them to bloom with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.70,0:27:17.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.66,0:27:24.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.79,0:27:29.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll walk through life with you slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.14,0:27:50.65,general text,,0,0,0,,This gift will only hinder them
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.09,0:28:13.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you. We'll eat everything
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.96,0:28:15.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.43,0:28:27.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.02,0:28:30.65,general text,,0,0,0,,This ahjusshi was crying
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.73,0:28:35.07,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ve never seen adults cry with snot
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.19,0:28:38.53,general text,,0,0,0,,He’s probably sick
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.61,0:28:39.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.27,0:29:08.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.64,0:29:11.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I brought you medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.40,0:29:12.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.95,0:29:23.28,general text,,0,0,0,,As soon as the shaman Choi’s brother speaks,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.37,0:29:25.16,general text,,0,0,0,,we can catch Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.24,0:29:28.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I need to ask Jin Mu something
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.16,0:29:32.75,general text,,0,0,0,,My father himself decided to become a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.83,0:29:35.71,general text,,0,0,0,,or was there some kind of story behind this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.79,0:29:37.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Only he knows
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.42,0:29:42.97,italics,,0,0,0,,Stargazer Cho Chun died because of Gwangju Chang Gang
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.55,0:29:47.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Stargazer Cho learned that Gwangju used witchcraft
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.51,0:29:49.23,general text,,0,0,0,,For fear that everything will be revealed,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.31,0:29:52.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu made him a nomad and he went wild
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.60,0:29:54.23,general text,,0,0,0,,This means,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.31,0:29:56.94,general text,,0,0,0,,that we killed an innocent person?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.41,0:30:04.70,italics,,0,0,0,,Not our fault
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.32,0:30:07.16,general text,,0,0,0,,We didn’t know the whole story
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.12,0:30:09.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone thinks,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.41,0:30:12.71,general text,,0,0,0,,that astrologer Cho killed his family because he became interested in witchcraft
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.54,0:30:17.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwangju asked to clear Cho Chun's name
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.92,0:30:21.80,general text,,0,0,0,,We will discuss this at the next Unified Council
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.88,0:30:25.05,general text,,0,0,0,,But why did Jin Mu go so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.14,0:30:27.30,general text,,0,0,0,,If he wanted to keep Cho Chun silent,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.39,0:30:28.85,general text,,0,0,0,,why did he turn him
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.93,0:30:32.64,general text,,0,0,0,,in the soul swallower and forced to kill the whole family?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.94,0:30:36.11,italics,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu knew everything
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.69,0:30:40.23,general text,,0,0,0,,about the circumstances of Chan Wook’s birth
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.49,0:30:42.99,general text,,0,0,0,,He did it
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.07,0:30:44.99,general text,,0,0,0,,with Chang Gun's friend, Cho Chun,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.37,0:30:48.45,general text,,0,0,0,,just to torment Chang Gang
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.53,0:30:49.74,general text,,0,0,0,,This means,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.00,0:30:54.50,general text,,0,0,0,,that if Jin Mu is caught, he will give up
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.83,0:30:57.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr. Chan's secret
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.17,0:31:00.80,general text,,0,0,0,,We cannot allow this. Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.84,0:31:04.59,general text,,0,0,0,,must die
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.77,0:31:22.44,memories italics,,0,0,0,,If you place a curse on the soul reflectors, then
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.53,0:31:26.57,memories,,0,0,0,,you can control the soul that uses it
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.54,0:31:40.96,memories italics,,0,0,0,,You can make him go wild,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.80,0:31:46.18,memories italics,,0,0,0,,and then get rid of him when he petrifies
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.31,0:31:57.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Shaman Choi
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.81,0:32:02.27,general text,,0,0,0,,placed a curse on all the soul reflectors she created
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.03,0:32:07.11,general text,,0,0,0,,This is why I have not become a nomad to this day
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.82,0:32:10.62,general text,,0,0,0,,I will force all the nomads
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.70,0:32:14.45,general text,,0,0,0,,run wild in this capital, like Cho Chun that day
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.17,0:32:21.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Deputy,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.17,0:32:24.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook is about to leave Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.05,0:32:28.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Pine forest lets him go?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.18,0:32:29.13,general text,,0,0,0,,These are the rumors
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.22,0:32:31.39,general text,,0,0,0,,They say he is leaving the capital
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.47,0:32:33.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Will he leave everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.89,0:32:37.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook is my only weapon against the prince. If he leaves...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.23,0:32:39.27,memories,,0,0,0,,You have nothing to offer me,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.40,0:32:41.36,memories,,0,0,0,,Gwangju Deputy
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.31,0:32:44.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is he leaving Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.73,0:32:48.11,general text,,0,0,0,,He drank poison to get there, took possession of Chisu
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.20,0:32:51.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe he even has the power of the stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.24,0:32:52.70,general text,,0,0,0,,so why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.33,0:33:00.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe it has changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.13,0:33:07.55,memories,,0,0,0,,That means he has changed
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.63,0:33:09.93,memories,,0,0,0,,Why did he change so suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.93,0:33:13.85,general text,,0,0,0,,What made him change?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.60,0:33:17.98,memories,,0,0,0,,People change because of other people
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.48,0:33:22.15,memories,,0,0,0,,Find out who appeared just at the moment when he began to change
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.15,0:33:26.57,memories,,0,0,0,,This will be the answer
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.36,0:33:30.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Find out who appeared just at the moment when he began to change
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.24,0:33:32.91,memories,,0,0,0,,I came for Nak Su's sword
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.87,0:33:39.16,general text,,0,0,0,,It cannot be. It couldn't be Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.00,0:33:42.88,italics,,0,0,0,,He used Tansu, which was owned by Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.46,0:33:44.59,general text,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.79,0:33:47.88,general text,,0,0,0,,He probably learned this from Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.96,0:33:51.01,memories,,0,0,0,,I saw everything while I was with him in Danhyangk
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.09,0:33:54.72,memories,,0,0,0,,and there was no one with him except his maid
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.60,0:34:07.69,general text,,0,0,0,,He leaves with his maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.77,0:34:08.78,italics,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.86,0:34:12.78,general text,,0,0,0,,He takes Moo Dok with him, who follows him everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.92,0:34:30.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry for bringing you here
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.55,0:34:33.84,general text,,0,0,0,,You said that you need to buy a lot of things
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.93,0:34:35.51,general text,,0,0,0,,I will help
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.64,0:34:43.52,general text,,0,0,0,,If she is who I take her for...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.44,0:35:33.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.37,0:35:46.96,general text,,0,0,0,,- Are you okay?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.62,0:35:49.54,italics,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you hear me calling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.92,0:35:52.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.71,0:35:56.30,italics,,0,0,0,,Why didn’t I answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.76,0:35:59.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you also hear the ringing of bells?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.64,0:36:02.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Jell bells? I haven't heard
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.52,0:36:06.81,general text,,0,0,0,,- They’re not very good, let’s go\N - Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.15,0:36:11.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.82,0:36:15.61,general text,,0,0,0,,you gave me hope
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.16,0:36:26.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li, there is one over there
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.08,0:36:28.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Eh, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.54,0:36:30.42,italics,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.50,0:36:33.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li, you missed so many fish
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.34,0:36:36.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t regret the fish I couldn’t catch
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.67,0:36:38.34,general text,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.43,0:36:41.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Then this is a waste of time
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.14,0:36:43.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Otherwise it’s greed and obsession
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.01,0:36:46.31,general text,,0,0,0,,- What? \N- However,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.39,0:36:50.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I realized that there is pure sadness in loss
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.32,0:36:58.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Lately I’m starting to understand why people are sad,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.15,0:36:59.86,general text,,0,0,0,,when they see the flow of water,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.95,0:37:04.08,general text,,0,0,0,,passing season, and the setting sun
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.00,0:37:16.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Looking at this empty cart makes me sad
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.63,0:37:18.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok said to catch a lot of fish
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.30,0:37:21.68,general text,,0,0,0,,So will you leave the nomad next to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.68,0:37:28.10,general text,,0,0,0,,We kept our promise to you
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.85,0:37:30.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su pointed her sword at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.77,0:37:32.73,general text,,0,0,0,,and then lowered it
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.81,0:37:38.11,general text,,0,0,0,,So I hope that you will keep your end of the deal and let us go
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.19,0:37:40.36,general text,,0,0,0,,What happened to the ice stone that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.45,0:37:44.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Could it be inside you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.63,0:38:01.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Even if so,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.80,0:38:04.85,general text,,0,0,0,,it is absolutely useless
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.93,0:38:09.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t even control a drop of water, let alone a Goldfish
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.89,0:38:15.98,general text,,0,0,0,,If you start training again, you will be able to use this power
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.57,0:38:18.61,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw how the desire to master this power
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.69,0:38:21.95,general text,,0,0,0,,made people cruel and evil
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.86,0:38:26.03,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s better not to awaken the power of the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.08,0:38:31.16,general text,,0,0,0,,You are greedy for fish,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.25,0:38:33.25,general text,,0,0,0,,don’t you care about the ice stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.54,0:38:36.17,general text,,0,0,0,,You are better than me
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.42,0:38:42.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Anyway, as long as I have the ice stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.01,0:38:46.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I can protect one person
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.26,0:38:50.52,general text,,0,0,0,,If Moo Dok goes wild,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.60,0:38:54.06,general text,,0,0,0,,help me use this power to stop this
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.14,0:38:58.65,general text,,0,0,0,,She'll be fine as long as she doesn't try to show her power
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.23,0:39:02.86,general text,,0,0,0,,In this weak body hides the powerful soul of a killer
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.94,0:39:05.66,general text,,0,0,0,,If anything had happened, she would have already gone wild
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.74,0:39:07.53,general text,,0,0,0,,She didn’t go wild because,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.62,0:39:10.99,general text,,0,0,0,,that her body is controlled by the power of the soul
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.62,0:39:15.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I realized this when we first met
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.59,0:39:23.13,general text,,0,0,0,,The only thing comparable to the power of a magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.22,0:39:25.34,general text,,0,0,0,,these are the divine powers of the priestesses
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.89,0:39:30.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I think Mu Deok's body originally belonged to
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.85,0:39:33.31,general text,,0,0,0,,to someone with divine powers
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.29,0:39:59.29,memories,,0,0,0,,This will help ease the pain
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.46,0:40:04.09,memories,,0,0,0,,It will only make it easier, but will not get rid of it
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.38,0:40:07.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I have to give this to him
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.72,0:40:17.56,general text,,0,0,0,,You dug your own grave
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.90,0:40:22.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Dare to deceive me, pretending to be my daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.19,0:40:24.07,general text,,0,0,0,,So I?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.78,0:40:28.61,general text,,0,0,0,,You were not deceived
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.70,0:40:31.45,general text,,0,0,0,,You knew, but you were pretending
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.99,0:40:34.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Is it because of the ice stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.41,0:40:37.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.71,0:40:40.83,general text,,0,0,0,,A mother always recognizes her child
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.50,0:40:44.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Before you loose your tongue,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.13,0:40:48.30,general text,,0,0,0,,it’s better to kill you here and now
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.80,0:40:51.18,general text,,0,0,0,,So you and this
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.68,0:40:54.01,general text,,0,0,0,,do you recognize?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.85,0:40:57.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Bu Young was wearing this bandage when she disappeared
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.52,0:41:00.44,general text,,0,0,0,,You said that you embroidered it yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.91,0:41:14.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Where did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.62,0:41:16.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Did Jin Mu give you this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.16,0:41:20.08,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.08,0:41:24.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Only I know who its real owner is
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.84,0:41:26.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.55,0:41:29.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Your daughter is still alive
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.01,0:41:32.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.09,0:41:34.89,general text,,0,0,0,,and you will never see her again
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.47,0:41:38.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I will spare your life
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.18,0:41:41.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.23,0:41:46.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t rush me
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.53,0:41:52.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I will tell you when I am sure of my safety
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.30,0:42:10.92,general text,,0,0,0,,The ice stone has disappeared
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.42,0:42:14.09,general text,,0,0,0,,But there were nomads who were created by Choi’s brother and sister
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.18,0:42:16.35,general text,,0,0,0,,and their organization
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.06,0:42:20.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor and Jinyeowon will destroy them all
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.73,0:42:24.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I ask for your help
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.23,0:42:29.99,general text,,0,0,0,,You ask me
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.61,0:42:33.03,general text,,0,0,0,,didn’t protect Jin Mu even if he was caught?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.11,0:42:37.70,general text,,0,0,0,,I know that he was your teacher, but I believe that you are not blinded by him
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.16,0:42:41.50,general text,,0,0,0,,So you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.79,0:42:44.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Then you believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.96,0:42:47.92,general text,,0,0,0,,that I was born under the star of the King and removed the barrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.63,0:42:56.34,general text,,0,0,0,,The ice stone barrier was lifted and you were there
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.43,0:42:58.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Then the King’s star shone
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.22,0:43:03.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Because, like everyone else, I believe that a star has shone above you
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.86,0:43:10.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I was not alone here that day
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.86,0:43:13.24,general text,,0,0,0,,You stood there
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.32,0:43:17.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Who would notice someone else besides you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.24,0:43:21.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook was there, I'm sure you saw him
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.87,0:43:25.79,general text,,0,0,0,,He is like a son to me
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.92,0:43:29.17,general text,,0,0,0,,You saved his life, Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.17,0:43:32.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I am truly grateful for this
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.93,0:43:45.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Today I am leaving Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.77,0:43:47.02,general text,,0,0,0,,I leave the work here
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.31,0:43:51.86,general text,,0,0,0,,You went through so much to get this job
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.61,0:43:54.94,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s a pity that you are leaving because of the wedding
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.61,0:43:59.24,general text,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, you will become the lady of the Chan family
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.95,0:44:04.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, congratulations on your wedding
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.12,0:44:05.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.17,0:44:14.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's do it now. Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.26,0:44:18.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you standing there? Follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.81,0:44:27.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, thank you for saving my life
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.19,0:44:31.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope the King's star will shine forever
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.65,0:44:33.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Enough. No need to pretend
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.44,0:44:35.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.99,0:44:41.32,general text,,0,0,0,,You know it was Chan Wook who saved everyone that day
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.41,0:44:45.62,general text,,0,0,0,,As you two agreed, I will not tell a single living soul
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.70,0:44:46.87,general text,,0,0,0,,So don't worry
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.79,0:44:52.13,general text,,0,0,0,,You think I'm worried about losing fame?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.21,0:44:54.84,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm just annoyed by everyone's flattery
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.92,0:44:57.67,general text,,0,0,0,,They all praise you
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.76,0:45:01.01,general text,,0,0,0,,You can just accept this praise
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.09,0:45:03.89,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s unpleasant to hear flattery from strangers, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.60,0:45:06.81,general text,,0,0,0,,When you thank me, knowing the whole truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.43,0:45:11.19,general text,,0,0,0,,it seems like you're kidding me. Annoying
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.40,0:45:18.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I understand that you are uncomfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.78,0:45:23.45,general text,,0,0,0,,You will never see me again
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.95,0:45:25.03,general text,,0,0,0,,So don't worry
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.08,0:45:28.16,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.54,0:45:32.04,general text,,0,0,0,,- You're leaving with him\N{\i1}- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.13,0:45:35.46,general text,,0,0,0,,We are going to move away from here and live together
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.05,0:45:37.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Together?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.97,0:45:42.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I could easily stop you from leaving
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.76,0:45:44.80,general text,,0,0,0,,You think I'll let him go,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.64,0:45:47.27,general text,,0,0,0,,when does he know my weakness?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.06,0:45:54.90,general text,,0,0,0,,And if we stay close, how will you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.53,0:46:00.95,general text,,0,0,0,,It won’t end with just one irritation
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.29,0:46:08.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.79,0:46:11.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Won Moo Deok, you listened to my petty complaints
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.75,0:46:14.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Listen to this too
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.59,0:46:18.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I will feel worthless, knowing that he did what I couldn’t
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.26,0:46:22.76,general text,,0,0,0,,And pretending that this is all my merit, I will become even more pathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.84,0:46:23.89,general text,,0,0,0,,But most powerfully
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.76,0:46:27.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I will fiercely despise...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.85,0:46:32.69,general text,,0,0,0,,both of you, seeing you together
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.36,0:46:37.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I already said,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.61,0:46:41.07,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t hold on to what I can’t hold on to
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.15,0:46:43.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know what will happen if I try to hold someone and I can’t?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.78,0:46:47.87,general text,,0,0,0,,You will blame this man
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.24,0:46:50.87,general text,,0,0,0,,and get rid of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.95,0:46:54.79,general text,,0,0,0,,If self-pity turns into cruelty or anger,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.59,0:47:00.63,general text,,0,0,0,,avoiding me won’t fix anything
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.26,0:47:05.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Go so far that I
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.18,0:47:08.47,general text,,0,0,0,,couldn’t get you
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.74,0:47:23.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.99,0:47:26.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm getting married tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.91,0:47:34.04,general text,,0,0,0,,You boys
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.62,0:47:37.75,general text,,0,0,0,,We won’t see each other so often anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.83,0:47:38.75,italics,,0,0,0,,Of course not
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.84,0:47:41.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Young would not allow this
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.96,0:47:43.76,general text,,0,0,0,,- Neither his mother-in-law\N- Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.92,0:47:46.51,general text,,0,0,0,,He won’t come again
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.22,0:47:48.85,general text,,0,0,0,,ride horses
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.93,0:47:50.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Or go fishing with us
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.97,0:47:55.06,general text,,0,0,0,,I will find time to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.14,0:47:57.81,general text,,0,0,0,,And how? Are you going to lie about training?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.90,0:48:00.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Were you seriously going to lie to the priestess of Jinyoewon?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.77,0:48:02.48,general text,,0,0,0,,He will be caught immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.57,0:48:05.07,general text,,0,0,0,,She will surround you with her relics
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.15,0:48:06.61,general text,,0,0,0,,and will demand the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.70,0:48:08.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Then you confess everything
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.03,0:48:11.74,general text,,0,0,0,,They will pluck out all his hair
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.83,0:48:13.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's start with the fact that he has thin hair
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.58,0:48:20.54,italics,,0,0,0,,I understand
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.63,0:48:21.79,general text,,0,0,0,,You envy me
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.63,0:48:24.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm still happy
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.96,0:48:27.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I will marry my first love
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.34,0:48:32.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I give you, bachelors, my good energy
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.22,0:48:38.27,general text,,0,0,0,,- Caught\N- Yes, you have Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.35,0:48:40.40,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- But she is not your first love
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.48,0:48:43.19,general text,,0,0,0,,- Is she already the eighth?\N- No... not... no
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.27,0:48:45.65,general text,,0,0,0,,- Just don’t tell her that\N- Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.74,0:48:47.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll leave you
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.70,0:48:50.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul, you can take my energy
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.28,0:48:51.32,general text,,0,0,0,,No need
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.37,0:48:53.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I was recently rejected
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.66,0:48:54.83,italics,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.91,0:48:56.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.62,0:48:58.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.84,0:49:03.96,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.50,0:49:07.47,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t have feelings for her
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.76,0:49:13.72,italics,,0,0,0,,Then who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.60,0:49:16.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk, do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.81,0:49:18.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, I have my own guesses
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.69,0:49:27.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you decided where you will go, Chan Wook?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.44,0:49:31.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Sari Village. I want to know something
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.45,0:49:34.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to return to Soho Fortress?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.49,0:49:37.62,general text,,0,0,0,,You're leaving right after my wedding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.70,0:49:39.16,general text,,0,0,0,,A little later, I think
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.00,0:49:41.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I am not cured yet
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.62,0:49:43.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Does it still hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.33,0:49:45.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that the wound has already healed
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.75,0:49:47.67,general text,,0,0,0,,What? Is Master Huo a charlatan?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.51,0:49:50.05,italics,,0,0,0,,The wound has healed,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.13,0:49:51.59,general text,,0,0,0,,but it still hurts me
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.14,0:49:54.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.69,0:50:09.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr. So Yul
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.28,0:50:13.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know if I should give this to you
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.53,0:50:16.87,general text,,0,0,0,,But one beggar woman asked to convey
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.92,0:50:33.18,italics,,0,0,0,,This medicine will relieve chest pain
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.26,0:50:34.93,italics,,0,0,0,,You must accept it
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.26,0:50:38.39,offscreen,,0,0,0,,This person knows about my condition
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.10,0:50:40.22,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.49,0:50:54.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I knew you would return, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.91,0:50:59.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook is exhausted, I'll send him away from here
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.24,0:51:01.37,general text,,0,0,0,,He doesn’t have an ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.04,0:51:04.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Admit your crimes by the end of the day
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.96,0:51:06.21,general text,,0,0,0,,If you don’t do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.54,0:51:10.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I will catch you and punish you myself
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.80,0:51:16.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone is deceiving you
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.01,0:51:21.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you see the head of Sosnovy Bor today?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.93,0:51:23.60,general text,,0,0,0,,What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.68,0:51:26.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Were you delighted that the star was shining above you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.69,0:51:31.36,general text,,0,0,0,,He knows it was Chan Wook, not you
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.74,0:51:35.99,italics,,0,0,0,,So is Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.07,0:51:37.99,general text,,0,0,0,,He broke into the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.07,0:51:40.33,general text,,0,0,0,,and mentioned the King's star
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.37,0:51:46.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to say that everyone is deceiving me and mocking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.00,0:51:49.42,general text,,0,0,0,,They are trying to protect Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.00,0:51:51.84,general text,,0,0,0,,The one for whom the star shines has the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.92,0:51:53.30,general text,,0,0,0,,and Pine Forest protects him
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.38,0:51:56.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Only I can protect you
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.39,0:52:03.81,italics,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook is keeping a big secret
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.39,0:52:05.94,general text,,0,0,0,,I will expose him...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.48,0:52:08.56,general text,,0,0,0,,and...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.48,0:52:13.23,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll make you sink to the very bottom
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.95,0:52:24.04,italics,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.04,0:52:27.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Who drank it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.54,0:52:28.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Your cup is empty
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.83,0:52:30.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Was that you? You drank it all
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.54,0:52:33.13,general text,,0,0,0,,If the cup is empty, pour me another
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.21,0:52:34.63,general text,,0,0,0,,- Like this\N- Drink
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.71,0:52:37.26,general text,,0,0,0,,"Have a drink"? How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.34,0:52:38.72,italics,,0,0,0,,-“Drink”?.. \N- To the bottom
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.47,0:52:42.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is our young master!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.35,0:52:46.85,general text,,0,0,0,,We celebrated something today
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.93,0:52:49.56,general text,,0,0,0,,- Her departure from Sosnovy Bor\N- I see
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.65,0:52:52.15,general text,,0,0,0,,- Hello, Chan Wook\N- Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.73,0:52:54.53,general text,,0,0,0,,He is your young master
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.40,0:52:57.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry. My mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.07,0:53:00.20,italics,,0,0,0,,- That's right\N{\i0}- They drank too much
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.28,0:53:01.28,italics,,0,0,0,,Young Master
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.37,0:53:03.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Go here
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.00,0:53:10.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll show you something amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.08,0:53:11.54,general text,,0,0,0,,When Moo Deok is drunk,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.46,0:53:14.71,general text,,0,0,0,,she doesn’t speak dialect
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.38,0:53:17.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Amazing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.55,0:53:19.63,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.72,0:53:22.30,general text,,0,0,0,,show something really worthwhile
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.01,0:53:25.93,general text,,0,0,0,,But I can fly to the roof
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.02,0:53:28.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Really? Try it
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.35,0:53:30.19,general text,,0,0,0,,- Try it?\N- Try it
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.52,0:53:32.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Look carefully
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.61,0:53:41.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Just a second
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.58,0:53:45.99,general text,,0,0,0,,- Mu Dok...\N- Not working
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.08,0:53:47.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Sit down
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.12,0:53:49.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Can’t do it anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.79,0:53:52.71,general text,,0,0,0,,And I can’t draw my sword
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.79,0:53:54.46,general text,,0,0,0,,What? This?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.54,0:53:57.13,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not yours. This is Nak Soo's sword
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.96,0:53:59.30,italics,,0,0,0,,- Young Master\N{\i0}- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.38,0:54:03.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you bring this garbage again?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.72,0:54:05.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll get rid of him
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.51,0:54:08.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Give me one more chance
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.31,0:54:09.56,general text,,0,0,0,,- Of course, try\N- Sit down
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.64,0:54:11.60,italics,,0,0,0,,Fly, do it
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.77,0:54:18.19,general text,,0,0,0,,- Clean up here and go to sleep\N- Have you seen this?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.28,0:54:20.03,general text,,0,0,0,,- I will deal with Moo Dok \N- I can fly
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.11,0:54:22.03,general text,,0,0,0,,- Don't move\N- It worked
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.11,0:54:23.99,general text,,0,0,0,,She really flew
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.12,0:54:27.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Chapter, did you see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.20,0:54:28.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I also want to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.04,0:54:32.00,general text,,0,0,0,,You kids have no idea who I am
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.08,0:54:35.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I am the master here. Do you want me to show you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.71,0:54:39.84,general text,,0,0,0,,I am the master here
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.51,0:54:42.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Today is just not my day
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.35,0:54:50.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.43,0:54:53.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Never drink again. You will tell everyone that you are Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.36,0:54:58.15,general text,,0,0,0,,I have to tell you something
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.23,0:54:59.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Sleep, you’ll tell me tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.61,0:55:02.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Needed today
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.45,0:55:06.32,general text,,0,0,0,,What if I die tomorrow without telling you anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.99,0:55:09.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, speak. Suddenly die
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.45,0:55:10.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm listening
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.21,0:55:16.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Chang Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.46,0:55:21.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I like you very much
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.44,0:55:41.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and went straight to bed
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.82,0:55:43.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Just like that
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.66,0:55:49.70,general text,,0,0,0,,We must tell her what Master Li said
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.41,0:55:54.50,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I think Moo Deok's body originally belonged to
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.00,0:55:57.33,memories italics,,0,0,0,,to someone with divine powers
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.71,0:56:01.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe I’ll find out how I get to the village of Sari
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.86,0:57:46.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Let bygones be bygones
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.07,0:57:49.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Now you will become relatives
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.61,0:57:53.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Young does not join the Park family
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.74,0:57:56.58,general text,,0,0,0,,This Dan Gu becomes part of our
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.45,0:57:59.00,general text,,0,0,0,,He is not moving in with you
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.75,0:58:02.71,general text,,0,0,0,,You say things like that, and people gossip,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.79,0:58:05.38,general text,,0,0,0,,that Park Dan Gu will soon become Jin Dan Gu
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.09,0:58:09.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Their daughters will give our surname
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.72,0:58:11.05,general text,,0,0,0,,And for my son - ours
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.09,0:58:14.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t argue on this wonderful day
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.89,0:58:16.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Guests will arrive soon
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.89,0:58:19.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Be ready to greet them
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.81,0:58:21.52,italics,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.73,0:58:25.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is Dan Gu?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.07,0:58:28.11,general text,,0,0,0,,He will go to Saejukwon with Cho Young first
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.69,0:58:31.40,general text,,0,0,0,,They want to get to her father and say hello
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.57,0:58:33.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is Moo Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.37,0:58:37.91,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know. She came first, but I didn't see her
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.50,0:58:42.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Is she embarrassed and avoiding me because of last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.69,0:59:47.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.94,0:59:51.82,general text,,0,0,0,,you can’t draw your sword because you’re stuck in this body
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.03,0:59:56.11,italics,,0,0,0,,You are my last weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.20,0:59:59.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I use all my power to call your
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.12,1:00:01.95,general text,,0,0,0,,As soon as you get your strength back,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.00,1:00:04.54,general text,,0,0,0,,you're going wild
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.05,1:01:05.06,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Only I know who its real owner is
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.81,1:01:08.19,memories,,0,0,0,,Your daughter is still alive
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.14,1:01:10.27,memories,,0,0,0,,Mother
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.32,1:01:22.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.58,1:01:31.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Where did your maid Moo Deok used to live?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.21,1:01:36.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Are her parents alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.01,1:01:40.26,general text,,0,0,0,,No. She comes from the village of Sari
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.34,1:01:43.89,general text,,0,0,0,,When she was accused of So Yi's crimes,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.97,1:01:45.51,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you everything
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.31,1:01:48.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I asked you to help this poor girl
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.85,1:01:50.31,general text,,0,0,0,,But you didn’t help
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.60,1:01:54.44,general text,,0,0,0,,So Yi knows Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.07,1:01:57.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Ms. Cho Young knows her too
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.12,1:02:05.87,general text,,0,0,0,,You are incredibly beautiful
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.12,1:02:10.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I can say the same about you
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.38,1:02:17.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's say hello to your father
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.84,1:02:19.59,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t stay here for long
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.17,1:02:23.30,general text,,0,0,0,,If the elders find out, they will sit on their ears
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.93,1:02:24.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.93,1:02:27.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.60,1:02:31.10,general text,,0,0,0,,man... husband
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.52,1:02:37.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Be careful,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.65,1:02:40.65,general text,,0,0,0,,female... wife
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.74,1:02:42.91,general text,,0,0,0,,My wife
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.28,1:02:45.62,italics,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.04,1:02:54.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok? Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.59,1:03:02.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok, you can’t bring the sword
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.59,1:03:07.89,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Kill Jin Woo Tak first
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.85,1:03:14.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.84,1:03:47.26,general text,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.76,1:03:50.89,general text,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.56,1:03:53.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Chang Wook’s maid?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.14,1:03:55.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.34,1:04:23.26,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Kill Jin Woo Tak
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.89,1:04:32.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.18,1:04:36.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.56,1:04:39.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.73,1:04:40.81,general text,,0,0,0,,what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.90,1:04:42.40,general text,,0,0,0,,She...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.48,1:04:45.19,general text,,0,0,0,,She is a mercenary
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.94,1:04:47.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Run, Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.20,1:04:48.45,italics,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.39,1:05:14.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.72,1:05:15.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop Mu Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.60,1:05:20.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.65,1:05:24.52,italics,,0,0,0,,Stop her!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.86,1:05:26.90,general text,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.93,1:05:57.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Kill her! Rather
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.49,1:06:16.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.99,1:06:20.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.58,1:06:21.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.25,1:06:24.08,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Father
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.67,1:06:27.71,italics,,0,0,0,,Father
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.17,1:06:30.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Father
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.17,1:06:32.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t die
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.10,1:06:37.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Dad, please...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.60,1:06:40.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Dad
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.15,1:06:44.27,memories,,0,0,0,,Dad
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.15,1:06:55.99,italics,,0,0,0,,Dad, don’t die
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.70,1:06:58.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.25,1:07:02.66,italics,,0,0,0,,kill those who did this to your father
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.04,1:07:09.25,italics,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.09,1:07:11.30,italics,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.38,1:07:12.76,italics,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.51,1:07:14.76,italics,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.92,1:07:47.13,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare you appear here?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.38,1:07:49.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Catch Jin Mu!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.51,1:07:53.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I, Deputy of Gwangju,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.13,1:07:55.01,general text,,0,0,0,,came to catch the nomad
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.59,1:08:00.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su, nomad, now in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.06,1:08:04.10,general text,,0,0,0,,- Nak Su?\N{\i1}- Chapter!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.65,1:08:10.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Trouble!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.19,1:08:12.69,general text,,0,0,0,,The mercenary appeared in Sejukwon
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.11,1:08:18.28,general text,,0,0,0,,She killed Mr. Jin
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.28,1:08:22.16,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the mercenary I'm looking for. Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.91,1:08:23.79,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.62,1:08:26.08,general text,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.16,1:08:27.37,general text,,0,0,0,,It was Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.46,1:08:31.29,general text,,0,0,0,,This Moo Dok is Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.64,1:08:39.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Mercenary!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.35,1:08:42.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Mercenary in Sejukwon!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.88,1:09:16.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Catch her!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.32,1:09:39.90,general text,,0,0,0,,- Catch!\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.17,1:11:21.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.01,1:11:26.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.39,1:11:30.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.10,1:11:36.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.03,1:11:42.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.38,1:11:58.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that me?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.42,1:12:01.67,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s me
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.92,1:12:05.30,general text,,0,0,0,,I pierced you
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.61,1:12:27.74,memories italics,,0,0,0,,One
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.20,1:12:33.08,memories,,0,0,0,,I will hold your hand in the ring of my hands
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.95,1:12:36.54,memories,,0,0,0,,Definitely no one has such a ring
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.75,1:12:42.05,memories italics,,0,0,0,,If I become Nak Su, I will be in danger
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.63,1:12:45.92,memories italics,,0,0,0,,It shouldn’t concern you what happens to me then
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.64,1:12:49.55,memories,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.05,1:12:52.26,memories,,0,0,0,,Because we will no longer be student and teacher?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.35,1:12:54.60,memories,,0,0,0,,You will have no reason to protect me
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.68,1:12:56.98,memories,,0,0,0,,And I have reasons to be gentler with you
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.19,1:13:00.36,memories,,0,0,0,,That was our promise
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.90,1:13:02.69,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Then promise one more thing
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.77,1:13:04.23,memories,,0,0,0,,When you get your power back,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.94,1:13:07.45,memories,,0,0,0,,if you have to raise a sword on someone,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.49,1:13:10.20,memories,,0,0,0,,let me be the first
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.45,1:13:12.62,memories,,0,0,0,,If you pierce me,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.70,1:13:17.46,memories,,0,0,0,,I will die to those who released the mercenary
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.09,1:13:25.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.55,1:13:30.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.85,1:13:36.60,general text,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.66,1:14:37.66,italics,,0,0,0,,Catch her!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.83,1:15:21.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.96,1:15:30.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.72,1:16:24.02,general text,,0,0,0,,I think,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.02,1:16:30.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Wook knew that Moo Deok was Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.03,1:16:33.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.44,1:16:37.41,general text,,0,0,0,,looking for evidence of this in Jeonjingak as we speak
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.95,1:16:44.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I knew it too
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.71,1:16:47.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Let me go after her
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.62,1:16:50.21,general text,,0,0,0,,and find out what happened
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.29,1:16:53.30,general text,,0,0,0,,You are the eldest son of the So family
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.30,1:16:57.05,general text,,0,0,0,,You didn’t know anything
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.51,1:17:01.51,general text,,0,0,0,,From this moment on, you are forbidden to leave this place
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.52,1:17:14.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Father died
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.53,1:17:18.20,general text,,0,0,0,,at the hands of a mercenary
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.82,1:17:20.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I will find
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.37,1:17:23.33,general text,,0,0,0,,and I’ll kill her
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.20,1:17:27.25,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.63,1:17:34.80,general text,,0,0,0,,You must find her and bring her back alive
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.55,1:17:40.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su is only a soul in this body
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.18,1:17:43.30,general text,,0,0,0,,I have to find out who this body belonged to
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.81,1:17:48.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Bring her back at any cost
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.61,1:18:01.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su practiced the alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.32,1:18:03.57,general text,,0,0,0,,along with the Choi family
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.37,1:18:06.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I've already caught her before,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.45,1:18:08.00,general text,,0,0,0,,when he killed all her people
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.08,1:18:10.75,general text,,0,0,0,,So I knew that Nak Soo was still alive
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.37,1:18:13.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I was looking for her all this time,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.04,1:18:15.63,general text,,0,0,0,,to clear your name
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.71,1:18:16.88,general text,,0,0,0,,And she is a daughter
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.96,1:18:19.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Chun, killed by the main families?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.26,1:18:23.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Probably entered Sosnovy Bor to avenge her father
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.26,1:18:27.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Chang Gang’s son kept her close, knowing who she was?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.14,1:18:28.93,general text,,0,0,0,,He's dead, we won't know that
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.02,1:18:32.60,general text,,0,0,0,,But I hope that you will punish Sosnovy Bor for everything
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.15,1:18:38.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is Nak Su?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.78,1:18:41.28,general text,,0,0,0,,The magicians of Jeonbugwan are looking for her
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.36,1:18:45.78,general text,,0,0,0,,She began to run wild, soon she will turn into stone and die
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.05,1:19:04.09,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.43,1:19:09.81,memories,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.85,1:19:14.98,memories,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.08,1:19:39.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t mourn, I can’t bury him
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.63,1:19:41.84,general text,,0,0,0,,properly, since he is a criminal
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.59,1:19:45.68,general text,,0,0,0,,How can he be cremated this way?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.14,1:19:49.89,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t do that!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.47,1:19:52.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop them...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.06,1:19:55.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.98,1:19:58.23,general text,,0,0,0,,has no voice
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.65,1:20:01.28,general text,,0,0,0,,in this question
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.28,1:20:04.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.92,1:20:26.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.57,1:21:29.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.41,1:21:35.49,general text,,0,0,0,,At least...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.42,1:21:42.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I no longer hear the sound of bells
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.92,1:21:50.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su will go to the grave of the nomads
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.14,1:21:54.26,general text,,0,0,0,,There he will meet his death
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.24,1:22:13.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Born under the star of the King, the power of heaven is subject to you
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.49,1:22:17.62,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not how you are destined to die,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.91,1:22:20.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Chang Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.90,1:22:49.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr.

